
<svelte:head><title>About — Grid Ubuntu</title><meta name="description" content="Grid Ubuntu: shared solar energy and intelligent community energy management, built in Zimbabwe for African communities."/></svelte:head>
<section class="bg-gradient-to-br from-[#1A2B1C] to-[#2D4A2F] px-6 py-24 text-white"><div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl text-center"><p class="mb-3 text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-[#9EB09F]">Our Story</p><h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold leading-tight">Built on the belief that <span class="text-[#8DC63F]">clean energy</span> should be a community asset, not a commodity.</h1><p class="mx-auto mt-6 max-w-2xl text-lg text-[#9EB09F] leading-relaxed">Grid Ubuntu was born from a simple observation: the infrastructure gap in rural Zimbabwe is not a hardware problem — it is a systems and software problem. We built the system to solve it.</p></div></section><section class="px-6 py-20"><div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl"><div class="grid items-start gap-12 lg:grid-cols-2"><div><h2 class="text-2xl font-extrabold text-[#1A2B1C]">The Problem We&#x27;re Solving</h2><div class="mt-5 space-y-4 text-[#5A6E5C] leading-relaxed"><p>Centralized national grid infrastructure was built for urban density. For rural communities scattered across vast distances, the economics of extending that grid have never worked — and they likely never will at commercial rates.</p><p>Individual solar home systems are an improvement, but they are expensive upfront, require technical maintenance most households can&#x27;t perform, and leave families isolated — unable to share excess energy or balance demand across neighbours.</p><p class="font-semibold text-[#1A2B1C]">Grid Ubuntu changes the economics entirely. A community solar micro-grid — managed by software — costs a fraction of the per-household alternative while providing more reliable power, automatic load management, and a built-in support network.</p></div></div><div class="space-y-4"><div class="rounded-2xl bg-[#F4F7F4] p-6 ring-1 ring-[#E3EDE3]"><p class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-[#3BAF4A]">60%</p><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-[#5A6E5C]">of rural Zimbabwe lacks reliable electricity</p></div><div class="rounded-2xl bg-[#F4F7F4] p-6 ring-1 ring-[#E3EDE3]"><p class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-[#3BAF4A]">8–12×</p><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-[#5A6E5C]">more expensive for individual vs. community solar systems</p></div><div class="rounded-2xl bg-[#F4F7F4] p-6 ring-1 ring-[#E3EDE3]"><p class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-[#3BAF4A]">0</p><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-[#5A6E5C]">upfront cost for households joining a Grid Ubuntu community</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class="bg-[#F4F7F4] px-6 py-20"><div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl"><div class="mb-12 text-center"><p class="mb-3 text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-[#9EB09F]">Enterprise-Grade Technology</p><h2 class="text-2xl font-extrabold text-[#1A2B1C]">Mission-first. Engineering-serious.</h2><p class="mx-auto mt-4 max-w-xl text-[#5A6E5C]">The social mission is community transformation. The engine underneath is built to global standards.</p></div><div class="grid gap-5 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4"><div class="rounded-3xl bg-white p-6 shadow-sm ring-1 ring-[#E3EDE3]"><div class="mb-4 flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-[#F5A623]/15 text-[#D97706]"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="19" height="19" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-zap" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 14a1 1 0 0 1-.78-1.63l9.9-10.2a.5.5 0 0 1 .86.46l-1.92 6.02A1 1 0 0 0 13 10h7a1 1 0 0 1 .78 1.63l-9.9 10.2a.5.5 0 0 1-.86-.46l1.92-6.02A1 1 0 0 0 11 14z"></path></svg></div><h3 class="font-bold text-[#1A2B1C]">Real-Time Telemetry</h3><p class="mt-2 text-xs text-[#5A6E5C] leading-relaxed">IoT edge devices stream wattage and relay status every 30 seconds over MQTT. The EMS reacts in under 2 seconds.</p></div><div class="rounded-3xl bg-white p-6 shadow-sm ring-1 ring-[#E3EDE3]"><div class="mb-4 flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-[#3BAF4A]/15 text-[#3BAF4A]"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="19" height="19" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-cpu" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 20v2"></path><path d="M12 2v2"></path><path d="M17 20v2"></path><path d="M17 2v2"></path><path d="M2 12h2"></path><path d="M2 17h2"></path><path d="M2 7h2"></path><path d="M20 12h2"></path><path d="M20 17h2"></path><path d="M20 7h2"></path><path d="M7 20v2"></path><path d="M7 2v2"></path><rect x="4" y="4" width="16" height="16" rx="2"></rect><rect x="8" y="8" width="8" height="8" rx="1"></rect></svg></div><h3 class="font-bold text-[#1A2B1C]">Edge Resilience</h3><p class="mt-2 text-xs text-[#5A6E5C] leading-relaxed">Each ESP32 node logs to local flash storage if WiFi drops, then bulk-syncs to the cloud on reconnection. No data gaps.</p></div><div class="rounded-3xl bg-white p-6 shadow-sm ring-1 ring-[#E3EDE3]"><div class="mb-4 flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-[#8DC63F]/15 text-[#71A030]"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="19" height="19" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chart-column" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 3v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h16"></path><path d="M18 17V9"></path><path d="M13 17V5"></path><path d="M8 17v-3"></path></svg></div><h3 class="font-bold text-[#1A2B1C]">Predictive Forecasting</h3><p class="mt-2 text-xs text-[#5A6E5C] leading-relaxed">Weather API integration predicts daily solar yield based on cloud cover, irradiance, and historical consumption trends.</p></div><div class="rounded-3xl bg-white p-6 shadow-sm ring-1 ring-[#E3EDE3]"><div class="mb-4 flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-[#3BAF4A]/15 text-[#3BAF4A]"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="19" height="19" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-globe" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="M12 2a14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0 20 14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0-20"></path><path d="M2 12h20"></path></svg></div><h3 class="font-bold text-[#1A2B1C]">AI-Powered Insights</h3><p class="mt-2 text-xs text-[#5A6E5C] leading-relaxed">Household residents and community operators both have access to an AI energy advisor trained on their real usage data.</p></div></div><div class="mt-8 rounded-2xl border border-[#E3EDE3] bg-white p-6"><p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-[#9EB09F] mb-3">Technology Stack</p><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2"><span class="rounded-full border border-[#E3EDE3] bg-[#F4F7F4] px-3 py-1 text-xs font-medium text-[#5A6E5C]">SvelteKit 2</span><span class="rounded-full border border-[#E3EDE3] bg-[#F4F7F4] px-3 py-1 text-xs font-medium text-[#5A6E5C]">FastAPI (Python)</span><span class="rounded-full border border-[#E3EDE3] bg-[#F4F7F4] px-3 py-1 text-xs font-medium text-[#5A6E5C]">Supabase (PostgreSQL)</span><span class="rounded-full border border-[#E3EDE3] bg-[#F4F7F4] px-3 py-1 text-xs font-medium text-[#5A6E5C]">MQTT / Mosquitto</span><span class="rounded-full border border-[#E3EDE3] bg-[#F4F7F4] px-3 py-1 text-xs font-medium text-[#5A6E5C]">ESP32 Microcontrollers</span><span class="rounded-full border border-[#E3EDE3] bg-[#F4F7F4] px-3 py-1 text-xs font-medium text-[#5A6E5C]">SCT-013 CT Sensors</span><span class="rounded-full border border-[#E3EDE3] bg-[#F4F7F4] px-3 py-1 text-xs font-medium text-[#5A6E5C]">Groq AI (llama3)</span><span class="rounded-full border border-[#E3EDE3] bg-[#F4F7F4] px-3 py-1 text-xs font-medium text-[#5A6E5C]">OpenWeatherMap API</span><span class="rounded-full border border-[#E3EDE3] bg-[#F4F7F4] px-3 py-1 text-xs font-medium text-[#5A6E5C]">Leaflet.js</span><span class="rounded-full border border-[#E3EDE3] bg-[#F4F7F4] px-3 py-1 text-xs font-medium text-[#5A6E5C]">Tailwind CSS</span></div></div></div></section><section class="px-6 py-16"><div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl text-center"><h2 class="text-2xl font-extrabold text-[#1A2B1C]">Partner with us to scale this</h2><p class="mt-4 text-[#5A6E5C]">We are seeking development partnerships, grant funding, and technical collaborators aligned with our mission of equitable energy access.</p><a class="mt-6 inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-2xl bg-[#1A2B1C] px-7 py-3.5 text-sm font-bold text-white hover:bg-[#2D4A2F]" href="/contact">Start a Conversation <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a></div></section>